{
  "_doc": "Classifies a property NAME (never a value). The name is split into lower-case words (camelCase, snake_case, spaces, $prefix). The first class in `order` with a matching word or phrase wins; nothing matching is `other`. A class is sensitive unless listed in `not_sensitive`. Review a new name by adding it here, not by editing a run's output. `exact` matches the whole name only (so `Screen Name` is not contact, while `name` is). A name whose last word is in `neutral_last_words` (Message ID, Topic Count) is about the thing, not its content, so the classes in `neutral_applies_to` skip it.",
